WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:07.277
"The game has rules," Jane says.

2
00:00:07.278 --> 00:00:14.718
"It was just a joke," Pip says.

3
00:00:14.719 --> 00:00:19.960
Jane puts Pip's dot back.

4
00:00:19.961 --> 00:00:24.474
"Now I will go," Jane says.

5
00:00:24.475 --> 00:00:27.623
Pip pokes Jane.

6
00:00:27.624 --> 00:00:30.718
"Stop that!" she says.

7
00:00:30.719 --> 00:00:36.165
But Pip pokes her on the nose. "Bop!"

8
00:00:36.166 --> 00:00:44.254
"Gran!" Jane runs to the stove.

9
00:00:44.255 --> 00:00:46.517
Pip goes too.

10
00:00:46.518 --> 00:00:49.918
"Pip is rude!" Jane says.

11
00:00:49.919 --> 00:00:53.670
"Jane tells me what to do," Pip says.

12
00:00:53.671 --> 00:01:03.566
"You broke the rules!" Jane says.

13
00:01:03.567 --> 00:01:10.580
"Pip, don't play jokes on Jane," Gran says.

14
00:01:10.581 --> 00:01:16.540
"And Jane, don't boss Pip."

15
00:01:16.541 --> 00:01:28.366
They nod. "Sorry, Gran."

16
00:01:28.367 --> 00:01:38.882
Jane and Pip go back to the game.

17
00:01:38.883 --> 00:01:43.806
Pip hums a tune.

18
00:01:43.807 --> 00:01:48.293
"Your tune is not cute," Jane says.

19
00:01:48.294 --> 00:01:53.707
"Yes, it is," Pip says. "Just like me!"

20
00:01:53.708 --> 00:02:00.522
He hums again.

21
00:02:00.523 --> 00:02:11.305
"Ugh!" Jane takes the dice. "Five."

22
00:02:11.306 --> 00:02:16.059
She puts her dot on a rose tile.

23
00:02:16.060 --> 00:02:20.042
A puff of smoke rises from the tile.

24
00:02:20.043 --> 00:02:31.999
Then there is a white flash.

25
00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:35.766
"What is that?" Jane says.

26
00:02:35.767 --> 00:02:41.945
Pip gasps. "It's a sprite!"

